  "description": "Print ZPL labels, barcodes and ESC/POS receipts from Blazor Server and .NET 10 applications to local Windows and network TCP printers. Open-source RAW printing agent by SinergiaAI with a browser-to-agent WebSocket connection, durable local queue, website authorization and idempotent request keys. The application generates printer-ready bytes; no PDF, HTML or image conversion.",
